    <title>
      ‎Yalla - Group Voice Chat Rooms on the App Store
    </title>
      <meta name="keywords" content="Yalla - Group Voice Chat Rooms, Yalla Technology FZ-LLC, Entertainment,Social Networking, ios apps, app, appstore, app store, iphone, ipad, ipod touch, itouch, itunes">

      <meta name="description" content="Read reviews, compare customer ratings, see screenshots, and learn more about Yalla - Group Voice Chat Rooms. Download Yalla - Group Voice Chat Rooms and enjoy it on your iPhone, iPad, and iPod touch.">

