13,8\":140746752,\"iPad13,9\":140746752,\"iPad13,4\":140746752,\"iPad13,5\":140746752,\"iPad13,6\":140746752,\"iPad13,7\":140746752,\"iPad13,1\":140746752,\"iPad13,2\":140746752}},\"relationships\":{\"app-events\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/app-events?l=en-US\",\"data\":[]},\"reviews\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/reviews?l=en-US\",\"next\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/reviews?l=en-US\u0026offset=10\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"4290563331\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-09T17:36:42Z\",\"review\":\"Like the site been in it few years, like some improvements only thing I can see is make it a lil easier if you’re in a chat room and you go and check out someone's profile that you don't have to go all the way back to getting into the room should be able to just hit an arrow or something to go back to the room. Also need to work on banning people a lil better. Otherwise like the changes so far keep up the great work. Suave_n_debonair.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Duilio Kienle\",\"title\":\"Five star\"}},{\"id\":\"4280052747\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-07T22:29:52Z\",\"review\":\"I have never heard of this app until I kept getting strange calls from people saying they got my number off this app. I eventually logged in because all it asks is for your phone number and password (I clicked on forgot password and got a link sent to my phone). They had a whole account set up and were using it to talk to people!!! So whoever was using this account was using my phone number!!! Not cool!!! Stupid teenage kids\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Lohgan Bengochea\",\"title\":\"Blocked\"}},{\"id\":\"5750138391\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-04-02T09:36:34Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":14552798,\"body\":\"Hello dear! We are happy to be with you in Yalla. Yalla is an original application that allows you to meet new friends from around the Arab world. We hope that your next comment will also be five stars. If you have suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live.\",\"modified\":\"2020-04-09T01:42:46Z\"},\"review\":\"I’ve been using this app for a good amount of time , my experience has been superb so far👌👌. After joining in yalla,  everyone welcomed me like a family and I became one of them eventually. Here, I’ve been talking to different people, making friends, playing games , earning gifts and doing many other lucrative  activities. This app has made my online time worthwhile. ❤️❤️\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Frenkie'10\",\"title\":\"A big shout-out to yalla\"}},{\"id\":\"4284170339\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-08T15:17:09Z\",\"review\":\"Omg when I first downloaded this I was so excited I already had like 20 views but then the ppl on there didn’t say anything not at all and I look at the profiles and there never on,there not following anyone and they have no pic finally one told me to smile then I got suspicious why did this dude want me to smile? I think this is just an app for hackers to get info (my opinion)\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Hulon Janiszewski\",\"title\":\"Concerns\"}},{\"id\":\"4284196784\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-08T15:22:46Z\",\"review\":\"If you asked questions nobody would answer, they would just say random things over and over again. The viewers would just do nothing. If I asked if they were real there would be not 1 comment. If there was a comment it wasn’t even related to what I was talking about. I don’t recommend getting this app.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Jomara Blenkharn\",\"title\":\"Unprofessional\"}},{\"id\":\"5749915856\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-04-02T08:32:32Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":14646972,\"body\":\"Hi, most users (more than 99%) enjoy Yalla for free and they love to have fun with many friends together. Let us work together to develop Yalla to be the best Arab community for our brothers and sisters. If you have any suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live and we hope to see your distinguished comment with the five stars. Thank you!\",\"modified\":\"2020-04-14T05:29:30Z\"},\"review\":\"I’m using this app since last couple of months and I just forgot other apps for time pass. honestly I found a lot of good friends here and in party time I feel like I’m in a party house. just awesome. strongly recommending for all.... 😍😍\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"crowwwn\",\"title\":\"yalla is my favourite app since last few months..\"}},{\"id\":\"4290748067\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-09T18:21:14Z\",\"review\":\"I enjoy moco several times daily. The poker rooms have live interaction with other players and I even got a date ... occasional glitches that seem to be worked out whenever noticed ... but overall worth it. It's a complex of various social games and media .. mostly uncensored I believe ...\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Levertis Tregunnah\",\"title\":\"Love the app! but suggestions\"}},{\"id\":\"4273010830\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-06T14:55:01Z\",\"review\":\"When I was on the phone with my friend it was being all glitchy and not working it really upset me because you said the ad said that it was really good quality and it really upsets me that it wasn’t so if you could fix the quality now please it was really glitchy I’m not very happy\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Madisyn Currer\",\"title\":\"Exciting, isnt it?\"}},{\"id\":\"4286422607\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-09T02:26:12Z\",\"review\":\"This app is really cool!!! You can go live and watch people. I did have one problem though 😞 So it sent me something saying I got banned for inappropriate stuff but I NEVER DID ANYTHING!! I just wanted to go live because I was so bored. I am really mad this happened and I was hoping you could reach out to me. Thank you\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Blancha Quakley\",\"title\":\"Issues\"}},{\"id\":\"4286221241\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-09T01:35:33Z\",\"review\":\"So I got this app 2 years ago and I registered my phone number In. I now have TikTok and I can’t add my number in because it’s in here. (I’m guessing the two apps are related somehow) and I’ve tried to delete my number and log out of this app but it never works. Don’t get this app if you are planning on getting TikTok\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Kennieth Kemish\",\"title\":\"Great App!!\"}}]},\"top-in-apps\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/top-in-apps?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"1100991711\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1100991711?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=990\u0026salableAdamId=1100991711\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.99\",\"price\":0.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":false,\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.pro.oneDA\",\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"100 Golds\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Purchase this item, you will get 100 Yalla Golds.\"},\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/100-golds/id1091902866\"}},{\"id\":\"1100998137\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1100998137?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=8990\u0026salableAdamId=1100998137\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$8.99\",\"price\":8.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":false,\"offer