s/developers/1513786283?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"genreNames\":[],\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"name\":\"BLAGOL TECHNOLOGY CO., LIMITED\",\"mediaType\":\"Mobile Software Applications\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/blagol-technology-co-limited/id1513786283\"}}]},\"genres\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1514418573/genres?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"6016\",\"type\":\"genres\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/genres/6016?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"name\":\"Entertainment\",\"parentId\":\"36\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6016\"}}]}}},{\"id\":\"1317217120\",\"type\":\"apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1317217120?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"distributionKind\":\"APP_STORE\",\"supportsArcade\":false,\"isFirstPartyHideableApp\":false,\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"privacyType\":\"Data Used to Track You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_USED_TO_TRACK_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be used to track you across apps and websites owned by other companies:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Data Not Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"17+\",\"value\":600,\"rank\":4,\"advisories\":[\"Frequent/Intense Mature/Suggestive Themes\"]}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipod\"],\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/starchat-group-voice-chat-room/id1317217120\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.2,\"ratingCount\":849,\"ratingCountList\":[132,17,42,42,616],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.2 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"3.10\",\"name\":\"StarChat-Group Voice Chat Room\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Entertainment\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":true,\"artistName\":\"Guangzhou QiaHaoQingChun Information Technology Co., Ltd.\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 10.3 or later.\",\"devices\":[\"iPhone 5S\",\"iPhone 6\",\"iPhone 6 Plus\",\"iPhone 6S\",\"iPhone 6S Plus\",\"iPhone SE (1st generation)\",\"iPhone 7\",\"iPhone 7 Plus\",\"iPhone 8\",\"iPhone 8 Plus\",\"iPhone X\",\"iPhone XS\",\"iPhone XS Max\",\"iPhone XR\",\"iPhone 11\",\"iPhone 11 Pro\",\"iPhone 11 Pro Max\",\"iPhone SE (2nd generation)\",\"iPhone 12 mini\",\"iPhone 12\",\"iPhone 12 Pro\",\"iPhone 12 Pro Max\",\"iPhone 13 Pro\",\"iPhone 13 Pro Max\",\"iPhone 13 mini\",\"iPhone 13\",\"iPhone SE (3rd generation)\",\"iPhone 14\",\"iPhone 14 Plus\",\"iPhone 14 Pro\",\"iPhone 14 Pro Max\"]},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 10.3 or later.\"},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires macOS 11.0 or later and a Mac with Apple M1 chip or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"StarChat provides you a wonderful way to communicate with family, friends, and strangers. TOTALLY FREE! \\nYou just need to create a room and invite your friends, then you can hold an online party anytime anywhere. Not only voice chat, but you can also share your favorite songs and sing karaoke with friends. Online games will make your party more excited.\\n\\n6 Reasons you’ll love the StarChat app:\\n\\n1. NO FEES\\nStarChat is an absolutely free voice chat app! Once your phone connects to the internet (4G/3G/2G or WiFi), you can enjoy a really fluent, high-quality voice chat.\\n\\n2. Available in 40+ Countries\\nIf you are away from family or friends, a voice chat room will make you closer. Wherever you are, using StarChat to keep in touch with friends, then you will never miss big moments! \\n\\n3. Secret Room\\nLock the room and set a password, and only your friends could enter, which will be a wonderfully private place for you.\\n\\n4. Online Party\\nCan’t find a suitable place for the party? StarChat provides you an awesome chance to hold an online party. Birthday, wedding, Eid, or just real-time comments on football games, TV Series, girls’ gossip, any topic is fine. Suitable presents like cake, rose, ring, etc. are also provided. It’s a great chance to surprise your friends. \\n\\n5. More Entertainment\\nMore than voice! Text, pictures are also available. You will have fun with friends by playing games and singing karaoke.\\n\\n6. Join another Party\\nThere are many public rooms with different topics. Choose the room according to the topic, then you will find friends with the same interests. Meanwhile, you will feel free to talk with anyone without showing your face.\\n\\nIf you have any problems or feedback, you can contact us by：\\nFacebook: www.facebook.com/StarChatLive/\\nWebsite: www.starchat.live\\nEmail: support@starchat.live\\n\\nDownload StarChat now! Create your own voice chat room and hold an online party!\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"websiteUrl\":\"https://www.starchat.live\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.33.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"bug fixed.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-07T11:38:03Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.33\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fix several bugs\\r\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-04T18:13:14Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.32.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Several Bugs fixed.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-25T00:59:24Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.32\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Added CP Zone\\n2. Optimize special relationship function\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-23T14:38:06Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.31\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Added Province System\\r\\n2. Party moment is recorded now\\r\\n3. Optimize special relationship function\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-08T01:24:48Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.30.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fix several bugs\\r\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-16T17:22:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.30\",\"releaseNotes\":\"bug fixed.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-14T23:07:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.29\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Optimize group feature\\r\\n2. Fix several bugs\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-10T12:37:16Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.28\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Fix several bugs\\r\\n2. Guild founder can bind a chatting group for members now!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-17T23:04:16Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.27.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Added title system.\\r\\n2. Fix several bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-15T10:53:10Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.26\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fixed several bugs.\\r\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-07T12:18:38Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.25\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Upgrade guild functions\\r\\n2. Added SVIP Privilege\\r\\n3. Fix several bugs\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-30T02:16:41Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.24.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Fix several bugs\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-16T10:26:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.24\",\"releaseNotes\":\"\\r\\n1. Optimize the SVIP system\\r\\n2. Fix several bugs\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-12T15:21:22Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.23.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fix several bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-17T12:21:18Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.23\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Optimize the SVIP function\\n2. Fix several bugs\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-16T01:37:42Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.22\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.Optimize group chat function.\\r\\n2.Fixed several bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-01T14:57:27Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.21\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Added group chat function.\\n2. Fixed several bugs. \\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-27\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-27T23:07:49Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.20.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Fixed several bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-24T23:21:44Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.19.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Added game ranking list\\r\\n2. Added recommended new room\\r\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-08T15:07:52Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.18.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Add new SVIP privileges.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-07-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-07-24T07:13:12Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.17\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Support account deletion\\r\\n2. Wheel game optimization\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-29T14:18:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.16.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Upgrade the room mic, up to 20 can be set\\n2. Fixed several bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-11\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-11T12:25:57Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.15.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Feedback system upgrade.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-20T13:36:26Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"6.14.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Added room sound effects\\n2. Banner application function upgrade\\n3. Feedback system upgrade\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-04-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-04-29T16:39:21Z\"}],\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1317217120\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=85618