nt/Mild Alcohol, Tobacco, or Drug Use or References\",\"Infrequent/Mild Profanity or Crude Humor\",\"Frequent/Intense Mature/Suggestive Themes\",\"Infrequent/Mild Sexual Content and Nudity\"]}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipod\"],\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/hiya-group-voice-chat/id1526086695\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.4,\"ratingCount\":920,\"ratingCountList\":[73,35,49,74,689],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.4 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0.3\",\"name\":\"Hiya - Group Voice Chat\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Entertainment\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"artistName\":\"FUNI.PTE.LTD.\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 10.0 or later.\",\"devices\":[\"iPhone 5S\",\"iPhone 6\",\"iPhone 6 Plus\",\"iPhone 6S\",\"iPhone 6S Plus\",\"iPhone SE (1st generation)\",\"iPhone 7\",\"iPhone 7 Plus\",\"iPhone 8\",\"iPhone 8 Plus\",\"iPhone X\",\"iPhone XS\",\"iPhone XS Max\",\"iPhone XR\",\"iPhone 11\",\"iPhone 11 Pro\",\"iPhone 11 Pro Max\",\"iPhone SE (2nd generation)\",\"iPhone 12 mini\",\"iPhone 12\",\"iPhone 12 Pro\",\"iPhone 12 Pro Max\",\"iPhone 13 Pro\",\"iPhone 13 Pro Max\",\"iPhone 13 mini\",\"iPhone 13\",\"iPhone SE (3rd generation)\",\"iPhone 14\",\"iPhone 14 Plus\",\"iPhone 14 Pro\",\"iPhone 14 Pro Max\"]},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 10.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Hiya is a fantastic Group Voice chat app! Share your life with others all over the world.You will talk with others by sharing your stories or your ideas.Join an online party in Hiya anytime anywhere.Use exciting in-app features to make your party more excited!\\n\\nFree Group voice chat\\nJoin a group chat room and start a voice chat party, have fun with  your friends.Hiya is an amazing app to let you talk with a lot of interesting people easily.Whatever you are passionate about, we have a chat room for you. \\n\\nExceptional gifts\\nHiya extraordinary and stunning gifts are provided for you to express your wishes to your friends.\\n\\nGame center\\nPlay games together directly in a chat group! Come here and have fun playing awesome leisure games.\\n\\nEntertaining community \\nA community based on mutual respect among users, to  have fun and spend an enjoyable and relaxing time. With many gorgeous people by your side, you will never get bored.\\n\\nFast and easy Login\\nHiya support login with your Facebook , google or phone number. \\n\\nGet ready to have an amazing audio chat with your friends!\\nFor any feedback \u0026 inquiries: Official Customer Service\\nLeave your precious suggestions without any hesitation!\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.53.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"BUG FIX\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-09T00:17:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.53.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"BUG FIX\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-06\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-06T12:07:44Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.51.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"BUG FIX\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-29T05:59:05Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.50.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"BUG FIX\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-16T02:36:05Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.49.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"BUG FIX\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-06\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-06T02:07:26Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.48.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"BUG FIX\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-28T12:30:07Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.48.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"BUG FIX\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-20T01:11:19Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.46.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"BUG FIX\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-01\",\"releaseTimestam