\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"User Content\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"17+\",\"value\":600,\"rank\":4,\"advisories\":[\"Frequent/Intense Mature/Suggestive Themes\",\"Infrequent/Mild Cartoon or Fantasy Violence\",\"Infrequent/Mild Profanity or Crude Humor\",\"Infrequent/Mild Simulated Gambling\"]}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipod\"],\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/sango/id1509626067\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.3,\"ratingCount\":843,\"ratingCountList\":[84,36,37,63,623],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.3 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0\",\"name\":\"Sango\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Entertainment\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"artistName\":\"MQJC TECHNOLOGY PTE. LTD.\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 13.0 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 13.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Sango is the best place to go live and voice chat! Join now to meet awesome friends worldwide, showcase talents, and support artists! Share your life with others all over the world. You will talk with others by sharing your stories or your ideas. Join an online party in Sango!\\n\\nEnjoy your day with us!\\n\\n\\nWith Sango you can: \\n\\n- have a funny encounter\\n\\n- have a deep conversation\\n\\n- make new friends\\n\\n\\n---------Why Sango？---------\\n\\n\\nLive Voice Chat \\n\\n- Create a High-quality voice chat with up to 10 people in your Room.\\n\\n- Chat with strangers to expand your social community network.\\n\\n- Make use of our live voice chat with interactive voice emojis to have fun.\\n\\n\\nEntertaining Community \\n\\n-Create rooms more convenient \\n\\n-Sango is filled with diverse, voice content streaming every second!\\n\\n\\nWant more features? Get Sango right now!\\n\\n\\nFunny Tribal Theme\\n\\n-There are three tribes of Lion, Eagle, and Shark for you to join us. \\n\\n-Join a ‘Tribal’ and invite your friends and families too. More fun activities are waiting for you.\\n\\n\\nLIVE PK\\n\\n-You can challenge anyone by on click the button. The winner will get more awards, and the loser will accept funny punishment. \\n\\nHave PK with your friends and punish those who lose!\\n\\n\\nMini Games in Real-time\\n\\n-Sango Game box has more fun games waiting for you\\n\\n-Games can make you happier while chatting online. Find friends through playing games!\\n\\n\\nStatus symbol\\n\\n-Aristocrat is the exclusive status symbol of sango. There are different levels of aristocrat which has corresponding privileges, you can get the aristocrat and enjoy the privileges by paying monthly to activate it!\\n\\n\\nBECOME PART OF OUR SANGO SOCIAL COMMUNITY\\n\\n\\nSharing Moment\\n\\n-No matter daily life or mood quotes, sharing your life, Live your moments to Sango Instantly.\\n\\n-Send comments and express likes to your friends.\\n\\n\\nDiscover More Friends\\n\\n-You can easily change the country for the recommended content.\\n\\n-Don’t just listen to others’ Rooms! Share your thoughts in the chat, and support the one you like by sending comments and Gifts!\\n\\n\\nA diversity of gifts\\n\\n-We have animated gifts, festival gifts and gifts for specific events to show your adoration!\\n\\n-Here on Sango, you can not only express your likes but also receive likes from others. Come to Sango to see the new world!\\n\\n\\nCommon Interests Groups\\n\\n-Choose the topic you are interested in and talk with a group of like-minded friends!\\n\\n-Create a topic you are interested in and invite your friends and family to interact with you!\\n\\n\\nTalk and chat with talented people nearby or from all over the world.\\n\\nShare your special stories and promote social events on your profile page for everyone to see!\\nParticipate in online live stream events: Singing contests (Song Contests), Music Competitions\\n\\nVIP status for the best fans: Follow your favourite streamers and be the first to know when they go live.\\n\\n\\nSAY HELLO:\\n\\nWebsite: Sango.sg\\n\\nFacebook: @sangosocial\\n\\nInstagram: @sango_chat\\n\\nIf you have any questions when using the app: support@sango.sg.\\n\\nIf you want to be our partner: marketing@sango.sg\\n\\n\\nA Voice Chat Streaming app based on mutual respect among users, to have fun and spend an enjoyable and relaxing time. With many gorgeous people by your side, you will never get bored.\\n\\n\\nThis app is the perfect way to dive into the unknown world.\\n\\nMeet and chat with new friends to share your moments and relax!\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"websiteUrl\":\"https://sango.sg\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.3.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"\\\"Tribe Level\\\" is now online! \\nFriends who join the same tribe are like a big family. Singing, playing games, and chatting with other people in the tribe, while having a good time, can also increase the prosperity of your tribe.\\nThe most prosperous tribes will occupy the Tribe cover. Come and contribute to the tribe with your friends!\\n\\n\\\"Chat Head\\\" is now available!\\nThe Chat Heads allow you to quickly view and reply to messages anytime, anywhere on any page in Sango\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-04-01T14:32:05Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.3.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-Bug fix\\n-Improve user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-26T14:57:28Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.3.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"‒ The room is fully upgraded to a tribe, come and experience the voice room and chat group.\\n‒ Join a friend's tribe and hang out together.\\n‒ Now you can quickly enter the tribe's chat group in the chat list.\\n‒ The Story upgrade, come and promote your favorite stories to get more people to see them! \\n‒ You can now also permanently display your stories on your profile.\\n‒ Minor bugs fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-16T14:41:55Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-Bug fix\\n-Improve user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-08T18:17:06Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-Bug fix\\n-Improve user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-01T14:35:57Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-Bug fix\\n-Improve user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-22T17:05:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.2.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"‒ Video messages are now supported, go share your daily life!\\n‒ The Tribe upgrade, there are text channel and voice channel in the tribe now.\\n‒ Messages can be pinned in the tribe's channel. Quick access to important information on the channel.\\n‒ “Saved messages” account is here to help you save messages and find them again quickly.\\n‒ Minor bugs fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-14T22:33:23Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-Bug fix\\n-Improve user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-18T16:17:28Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"The Magic Cube is now online, come and get your hands on a rare rocket gift!\\nVoice call upgrade, enjoy chatting with your friends!\\nLinked messages are now available, so you can quickly preview the content of the links in your chat.\\nMinor bugs fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-15T12:05:57Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.0.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Sango Version 5.0 is fully launched! Meet all your social needs! Let's take a look!\\n‒ The Qatar World Cup Event is online, cheer for the teams you support!\\n‒ Whole new Tribe feature is incoming! Go to explore for more fun!\\n‒ Experience the new Channel Chat System with friends and enjoy chatting.\\n‒ Share your life through new Story feature.\\n‒ Chat system update to protect your privacy well.\\n‒ The Explore page is optimized, now you can quickly access interesting rooms\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-06\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-06T02:01:46Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.0.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Sango Version 5.0 is fully launched! Meet all your social needs! Let's take a look!\\n‒ The Qatar World Cup Event is online, cheer for the teams you support!\\n‒ Whole new Tribe feature is incoming! Go to explore for more fun!\\n‒ Experience the new Channel Chat System with friends and enjoy chatting.\\n‒ Share your life through new Story feature.\\n‒ Chat system update to protect your privacy well.\\n‒ The Explore page is optimized, now you can quickly access interesting rooms\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-03T15:56:41Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"5.0.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Sango Version 5.0 is fully launched! Meet all your social needs! Let's take a look!\\n‒ The Qatar World Cup Event is online, cheer for the teams you support!\\n‒ Whole new Tribe feature is incoming! Go to explore for more fun!\\n‒ Experience the new Channel Chat System with friends and enjoy chatting.\\n‒ Share your life through new Story feature.\\n‒ Chat system update to protect your privacy well.\\n‒ The Explore page is optimized, now you can quickly access interesting rooms\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-27\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-27T02:04:19Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.5.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-Bug fix\\n-Improve user experience\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-03T02:02:13Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.5.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-Gift wish function is online, helping the host to complete the task together.\\n-Minor bugs fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-30T08:44:16Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.5.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-Gift wish function is online, helping the host to complete the task together.\\n-Minor bugs fixes.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-24T09:17:21Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.5.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-Improve user experience\\n-Bug fix\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-03T07:43:02Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.5.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-New homepage style, quick access to fun rooms! \\n-Add a gift rack to your profile card in the room to make gift-giving easier! Enjoy the thrill of continuous gift-giving effects. \\n-Brand new to Fruit Coin Carnival. Join Fruit Party and win coins! \\n-Optimized room entry pop-ups, invitation to mic, official information adjustment and other modules. \\n- Minor bugs fixes. \",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-20T08:53:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.4.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"-Bug fix\\n-Improve user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-07-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-07-20T15:19:16Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- New UMO mini-games! An exciting and fun card game, get your friends together and play!\\n- Minor bugs fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-24T19:46:26Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.3.23\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- The new voting function is back, come and have a try!\\n- Fun Battle Time is online, support your favorite anchor to win the trophy！\\n- Minor bugs fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-07T17:14:06Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.3.022\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- Whole new mini game Ludo is available, come and enjoy this exciting game with your friends!\\n- Become a Top Game Host to win daily rides, frames and coins!\\n- Send gifts to your favorite users and get your exclusive room's own badge of honor\\n- Gift Scoreboard is online, you can check the received gifts value easily!\\n- Optimized room types icon, photo uploading, picture loading and other experience problems\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-31\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-31T20:55:02Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.2.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1、Improve user experience\\n2、Bug fix\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-25T20:57:08Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.2.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Fix some problems\\n2. Improve user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-12T17:16:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.2.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Fix some problems\\n2. Improve user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-09T17:18:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. BUG FIX\\n2. Improve user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-05T23:00:57Z\"}],\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1509626067\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=855845502\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":166889472}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1509626067\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=855845502\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":166889472}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2020-04-28\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"Sango.Sango.com\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is3-s