inch) (2nd generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad Pro (10.5‑inch)\",\"iPad Pro (10.5‑inch) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad (6th generation)\",\"iPad (6th generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad Pro (11‑inch)\",\"iPad Pro (11‑inch) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad Pro (12.9‑inch) (3rd generation)\",\"iPad Pro (12.9‑inch) (3rd generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad mini (5th generation)\",\"iPad mini (5th generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad Air (3rd generation)\",\"iPad Air (3rd generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad (7th generation)\",\"iPad (7th generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad Pro (11‑inch) (2nd generation)\",\"iPad Pro (11‑inch) (2nd generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad Pro (12.9‑inch) (4th generation)\",\"iPad Pro (12.9‑inch) (4th generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad Air (4th generation)\",\"iPad Air (4th generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad (8th generation)\",\"iPad (8th generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad Pro (11-inch) (3rd generation)\",\"iPad Pro (11-inch) (3rd generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad Pro (12.9-inch) (5th generation)\",\"iPad Pro (12.9-inch) (5th generation) Wi-Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad mini (6th generation)\",\"iPad mini (6th generation) Wi-Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad (9th generation)\",\"iPad (9th generation) Wi-Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad Air (5th generation)\",\"iPad Air (5th generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad (10th generation)\",\"iPad (10th generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad Pro (11‑inch) (4th generation)\",\"iPad Pro (11‑inch) (4th generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\",\"iPad Pro (12.9‑inch) (6th generation)\",\"iPad Pro (12.9‑inch) (6th generation) Wi‑Fi + Cellular\"]},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires macOS 11.0 or later and a Mac with Apple M1 chip or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Why are more and more people joining Mashi\\n\\n\\\"Mashi do provide a wonderful way to make new friends and \\ncommunicate with family, friends, and strangers. \\nNo matter what you are a voice chat lover or a video chat lover，\\nyou can have a great time here.\\n\\nDiscover the amazing features of Mashi \\n\\n-1V1 video chat—connect to your opponent through face-to-face video calls；\\n-Group voice chat rooms — talk with friends no matter where they are, \\nbroadcast your highlighs in group chat. Let's get the party started；\\n-Voice Party — Celebrating on your phone at any time and anywhere；\\n-Transnational Interaction — Don’t be surprised if you find people from other countries , \\nMashi chat is very popular among people in 27 Middle Eastern countries ；\\n-Massive Interactive Games — Having fun with friends by playing games and singing karaoke；\\n-Guild System — Join the Middle Eastern tribes to party together ；\\n-Stunning Special Effects - Getting surprises while you are giving gifts；\\n\\nLet's get Mashi party together！If you are fond of omegle.com video calling webcam or playing Among Us games, \\nMashi fits you perfectly. We will intelligently recommend high-quality users to chat with you and share the joy and bit by bit of life.\\n\\nIf you have any problems or feedbacks, please contact us by：\\nWebsite: www.mashichat.com\\nFacebook: facebook.com/mashichat/\\nInstagram: instagram.com/mashi.live/\\nGmail: mashi.chat@gmail.com\\nMashi ID: 10000\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.7.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and efficiency improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-01T02:04:16Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.6.10\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and efficiency improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-10T09:56:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.6.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and efficiency improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-04-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-04-28T01:55:56Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.6.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and efficiency improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-04-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-04-22T14:46:28Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.6.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixes and efficiency improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-04-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-04-21T02:01:16Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.5.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Adding video calling, you can have a more realistic and enjoyable social entertainment experience through one-to-one video calls!\\n2. Match your high-quality sweetie quickly and enjoy high-quality video calls!\\n3. Improve other experiences!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-03-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-03-09T09:29:53Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.5.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Adding video calling, you can have a more realistic and enjoyable social entertainment experience through one-to-one video calls!\\n2. Match your high-quality sweetie quickly and enjoy high-quality video calls!\\n3. Improve other experiences!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-02-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-02-22T02:22:19Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.3.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Add the list of kicked microphones, homeowners quickly check who is making trouble!\\n2. The dynamic expression display changes, no longer occupying the screen!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-12-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-12-03T02:11:28Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.2.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. New country-themed rooms! Come and compete with partners in the same country for the ownership of the national medal!\\n2. The family function is more perfect, experience the ever-changing family immediately!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-10-11\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-10-11T10:51:21Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. New country-themed rooms! Come and compete with partners in the same country for the ownership of the national medal!\\n2. The family function is more perfect, experience the ever-changing family immediately!\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-10-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-10-09T01:58:05Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.0.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Moved activity of \\\"Invitation to get coins \\\"，but you still can make an invitation and enjoy the time with more friends \\n2. Added more activities, celebrate your happiness with us \\n3. Function optimized. Try it now\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-04-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-04-14T02:11:49Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.0.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Adding Among Us and PUBG theme rooms! Come and play games with friends by using Mashi voice!\\n2. Adding Charm Star activity, rewards are abundant, who will be the Charm Star each week?\\n3. Weekly CP activity will be updated soon, and new CP exclusive gifts are coming, let everyone know that you two are CP!\\n4. Explore page changed, more gameplay, and the page is more concise.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-22T02:05:08Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.11.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Offering big price cut for high-grade aristocracy! Check it now!\\n2. Adding gift backpack and classification, make looking for gifts more convenient.\\n3. Weekly recharges rewards are updated, adding draw tickets and vehicles.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-09T04:17:30Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.11.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Offering big price cut for high-grade aristocracy! Check it now!\\n2. Adding gift backpack and classification, make looking for gifts more convenient.\\n3. Weekly recharges rewards are updated, adding draw tickets and vehicles.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-07T02:11:55Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.10.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"\\n1.New Year's Eve event is coming soon, and more rewards are waiting for you!\\n2.A new button is added to take the mic in the room, more convenient to use with one button.\\n3.Support IM and share to invite friends enter room in the room.\\n4.You can choose to hide the super supporters now. \",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-12-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-12-20T14:23:33Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.9.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Upgraded Aristocracy's privileges: exchange diamonds with more profitable exchange-rate, besides that The King could get private-customized gifts or themes for free\\n2. Updated Events' subscriptions: More fun events are waiting for your organizations\\n3. Add a new Medal as \\\"Verified supporter monthly,\\\" limited special-offered for only few\\n4. Optimize other functions.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-12-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-12-08T17:38:54Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.9.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Upgraded Aristocracy's privileges: exchange diamonds with more profitable exchange-rate, besides that The King could get private-customized gifts or themes for free\\n2. Updated Events' subscriptions: More fun events are waiting for your organizations\\n3. Add a new Medal as \\\"Verified supporter monthly,\\\" limited special-offered for only few\\n4. Optimize other functions.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-12-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-12-05T23:37:36Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.8.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Mashi is celeberating 1st anniversary! The first anniversary celebration has been launched, the rewards are waiting for u, come join!\\n2. The new version of the noble system is updated, adding more privileges and more noble!\\n3. The return event is launched for a limited time, and old users will receive rich rewards when they return.\\n4. Create a room with a lower level, and you can easily have your own room at level 1.\\n5. The room supports gold bean exchange and private chat, which is convenient and fast.\\n6. Small adjustments to the layout of the room inside and outside make it more comfortable to look at.\\n7. Now supports multi-platform account association, no longer afraid of losing Mashi account.\\n8. Language switching: English, Arabic, Turkish and French can be easily switched in the APP anytime, anywhere.\\n9. IM chat added read function.\\n10. Optimize other functions to improve user experience.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-11-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-11-22T22:44:23Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.8.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Mashi is celeberating 1st anniversary! The first anniversary celebration has been launched, the rewards are waiting for u, come join!\\n2. The new version of the noble system is updated, adding more privileges and more noble!\\n3. The return event is launched for a limited time, and old users will receive rich rewards when they return.\\n4. Create a room with a lower level, and you can easily have your own room at level 1.\\n5. The room supports gold bean exchange and private chat, which is convenient and fast.\\n6. Small adjustments to the layout of the room inside and outside make it more comfortable to look at.\\n7. Now supports multi-platform account association, no longer afraid of losing Mashi account.\\n8. Language switching: English, Arabic, Turkish and French can be easily switched in the APP anytime, anywhere.\\n9. IM chat added read function.\\n10. Optimize other functions to improve user experience.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-11-19\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-11-19T01:57:06Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.7.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Two new lucky gifts are added, with richer rewards! Who will be the luckiest?\\n2. Send multiple lucky gifts to one user at once. Super convenient!\\n3. Recommendation list optimization, making it easier for you to find the room you are interested in.\\n4. The rules of aristocracy is updated.\\n5. Optimize the user experience and fix some bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-10-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-10-29T01:41:47Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.7.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Two new lucky gifts are added, with richer rewards! Who will be the luckiest?\\n2. Send multiple lucky gifts to one user at once, super convenient!\\n3. Recommendation list optimization, making it easier for you to find the room you are interested in.\\n4. The rules of aristocracys is updated.\\n5. Optimize user experience and fix some bugs.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-10-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-10-26T23:55:42Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.6.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Turkish and French added.\\n2. Fix some bugs and optimize the user experience.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-10-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-10-20T11:15:24Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.6.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The new initial recharge gift packs is online!\\n2. Golds mode added on the Lucky spin, the excitement is up!\\n3. The lucky draw is online, let's see who is the lucky king!\\n4. More stage rewards added in weekly recharge activity and rewards are more abundant.\\n5. Now you can send gifts to each other directly during private chat.\\n6. If you receive gifts from other users in the room, click the \\\"send gifts back\\\" button.\\n7.  IM chat to see the other party's profile.\\n8. Some bugs fixed and optimize user experience.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-10-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-10-04T07:13:15Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.6.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The new initial recharge gift packs is online!\\n2. Golds mode added on the Lucky spin, the excitement is up!\\n3. The lucky draw is online, let's see who is the lucky king!\\n4. More stage rewards added in weekly recharge activity and rewards are more abundant.\\n5. Now you can send gifts to each other directly during private chat.\\n6. If you receive gifts from other users in the room, click the \\\"send gifts back\\\" button.\\n7.  IM chat to see the other party's profile.\\n8. Some bugs fixed and optimize user experience.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-09-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-09-30T11:05:02Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1、Lucky gifts are online,there is a chance to win 100 times golds reward by sending lucky gifts!\\n2、Lucky prize-drawing added,there is a chance to win special gifts,it's so funny and convenient!\\n3、Rooms competition is online, come and fight for rich golds reward!\\n4、Several bugs are repaired.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020